  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"eDWwS\" id=\"eDWwS\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0d7c8d8\" id=\"ub0d7c8d8\">for循环</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u8d56d133\" id=\"u8d56d133\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua14097a0\" id=\"ua14097a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub599ea4d\" id=\"ub599ea4d\">for</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ube0f4a5f\" id=\"ube0f4a5f\">循环的主要作用是遍历数据（容器)）中的元素。字符串、列表等高级数据类型都属于容器，都可以通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u959eab87\" id=\"u959eab87\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud98b8e68\" id=\"ud98b8e68\">for</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc56c0fae\" id=\"uc56c0fae\">循环遍历</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6410b3bc\" id=\"u6410b3bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3433e301\" id=\"u3433e301\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua1134c71\" id=\"ua1134c71\"><code data-lake-id=\"u094f8f6e\" id=\"u094f8f6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud162acd7\" id=\"ud162acd7\">for</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue81f4da3\" id=\"ue81f4da3\">循环的语法格式如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for%20%E4%B8%B4%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20in%20%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E6%88%96%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%AD%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%3A%5Cn%5Ct%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sf5EC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub8fbc672\" id=\"ub8fbc672\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5680a47\" id=\"ue5680a47\">使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u173b1ad8\" id=\"u173b1ad8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf18b434c\" id=\"uf18b434c\">for</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6e0ffcb9\" id=\"u6e0ffcb9\">循环遍历字符串中的所有字符</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ubbf43547\" id=\"ubbf43547\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-info\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5a40ba1d\" id=\"u5a40ba1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54aedf37\" id=\"u54aedf37\">需求:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7934a2aa\" id=\"u7934a2aa\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u117e376b\" id=\"u117e376b\">打印字符串'hello world'中每一个字符</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u95d6b694\" id=\"u95d6b694\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueaec937e\" id=\"ueaec937e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u322c41da\" id=\"u322c41da\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50f28077\" id=\"u50f28077\">代码如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22str%20%3D%20'hello%20world'%5Cn%23%20ele%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20%20%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%5Cnfor%20s%20in%20str%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(s)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zhNW2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"aMmjj\" id=\"aMmjj\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5902a8d2\" id=\"u5902a8d2\">in和not in</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3efd2354\" id=\"u3efd2354\"><span data-lake-id=\"u423158be\" id=\"u423158be\">​</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5766cd84\" id=\"u5766cd84\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89818f7a\" id=\"u89818f7a\">in</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucdba4473\" id=\"ucdba4473\"> 操作符用于判断元素是否存在于容器中，如果在容器中,返回 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ucddc70d9\" id=\"ucddc70d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud19c7212\" id=\"ud19c7212\">True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u279b7e86\" id=\"u279b7e86\">，否则返回 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9454827e\" id=\"u9454827e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud30f2be4\" id=\"ud30f2be4\">False</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22str%20%3D%20'hello'%5Cnresult%20%3D%20'h'%20in%20str%5Cnprint(result)%5Cnresult%20%3D%20'e'%20not%20in%20str%5Cnprint(result)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p5t5W%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u958c5316\" id=\"u958c5316\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24ed01d3\" id=\"u24ed01d3\">结果:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22True%5CnFalse%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U1FQf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Y20Dr\" id=\"Y20Dr\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce661f21\" id=\"uce661f21\">range</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u52e660d2\" id=\"u52e660d2\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1fad8d47\" id=\"u1fad8d47\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67818198\" id=\"u67818198\">range()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud6f9b5ac\" id=\"ud6f9b5ac\"> 可创建一个整数列表。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3fe87c77\" id=\"u3fe87c77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74288b2b\" id=\"u74288b2b\">range()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8bd1741e\" id=\"u8bd1741e\">相当于数学中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19f14d64\" id=\"u19f14d64\">左闭右开区间</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc225a175\" id=\"uc225a175\">（包含左,不包含右）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4a25b4af\" id=\"u4a25b4af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a0eec6e\" id=\"u9a0eec6e\">我们先看看数学中的区间：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua012db9b\" id=\"ua012db9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79ba33a7\" id=\"u79ba33a7\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub4ae105e\" id=\"ub4ae105e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u371d6bd7\" id=\"u371d6bd7\">全开全闭区间</span></p><ul list=\"ua8f6e62e\"><li fid=\"u9e4c890f\" data-lake-id=\"ued257ba1\" id=\"ued257ba1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40d0e345\" id=\"u40d0e345\">开区间：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u67175221\" id=\"u67175221\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee924a91\" id=\"uee924a91\">(1,10)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucb3e73a8\" id=\"ucb3e73a8\">  不包含1和10</span></li><li fid=\"u9e4c890f\" data-lake-id=\"u8ec7fced\" id=\"u8ec7fced\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6368d202\" id=\"u6368d202\">闭区间：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u490dd853\" id=\"u490dd853\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d3b5334\" id=\"u3d3b5334\">[1,10]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue74ede0a\" id=\"ue74ede0a\">  包含1和10</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u8fa88e33\" id=\"u8fa88e33\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45f3de05\" id=\"u45f3de05\">半开半闭区间</span></p><ul list=\"u14d80e94\"><li fid=\"u4a38e607\" data-lake-id=\"uf0700bf2\" id=\"uf0700bf2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ff25589\" id=\"u8ff25589\">左开右闭区间：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uec295c02\" id=\"uec295c02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1fb48fc9\" id=\"u1fb48fc9\">(1,10]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u03a4f30e\" id=\"u03a4f30e\">  包含10不包含1</span></li><li fid=\"u4a38e607\" data-lake-id=\"ude45619a\" id=\"ude45619a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub87985c6\" id=\"ub87985c6\">左闭右开区间：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1e1656b3\" id=\"u1e1656b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9d06d2a\" id=\"ud9d06d2a\">[1,10)</span></code><span data-l